  "name": "Question 3",
  "problem": "Given the function \n\n$$\nf(x,w)={w}^{T}x+4\n$$\n\nthat maps two vectors to a scalar, find ${∇}_{w}f.$",
  "worked_solution": "Using the result \n\n$$\n{∇}_{w}({w}^{T}x)=x,\n$$\n\nwe have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∇}_{w}f & ={∇}_{w}({w}^{T}x+4) \\\\  & ={∇}_{w}({w}^{T}x)+{∇}_{w}(4) \\\\  & =x+0 \\\\  & =x.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
